" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 圣启仁光抚照.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6a/dih76gutvea9e3f4c8z8oylvb68gcgh.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9C%A3%E5%90%AF%E4%BB%81%E5%85%89%E6%8A%9A%E7%85%A7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/6a/dih76gutvea9e3f4c8z8oylvb68gcgh.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%9C%A3%E5%90%AF%E4%BB%81%E5%85%89%E6%8A%9A%E7%85%A7.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/6a/dih76gutvea9e3f4c8z8oylvb68gcgh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />圣启·仁光抚照\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣启\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣启</font></span></span>]技能，牺牲自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>当前生命值，使目标友军回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">4</font>点能量、所有技能冷却回合减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>;再使目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有己方，获得随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级增益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣启\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣启</font></span></span>]时，技能变更，效果强化为:对中心目标额外回复2点能量，所有技能冷却减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />(技能变更为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">仁光抚照</font></span>])\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/m4gv8o4dpxzc7r9lpuzb4xhyp1ivq98.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/m4gv8o4dpxzc7r9lpuzb4xhyp1ivq98.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:80px;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"skill_icon_box\">\n<div data-type=\"@悬浮框/技能2\" data-name=\"仁光抚照\" class=\"bili-tt skill_icon_bg\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BB%81%E5%85%89%E6%8A%9A%E7%85%A7\" ti